# Strategy / commercial-intent / founder docs at internal/ root.
# WARNING: internal/ is Go's standard package-private directory and
# contains ALL the Rufio source code (internal/cli/, internal/lib/,
# internal/tui/, internal/mcp/, …). Do NOT ignore the whole directory.
# Only the four .md files at internal/ root are private.
#
# Tracked-then-removed in v1.0.6 A5 pre-public audit (2026-05-22) via
# `git rm --cached internal/{README,strategy,conversation-summary,
# kickoff-prompt}.md`. STILL IN GIT HISTORY while the repo is private —
# `git filter-repo --path internal/README.md --path internal/strategy.md
#  --path internal/conversation-summary.md --path internal/kickoff-prompt.md
#  --invert-paths` is QUEUED as the final pre-public step before opening.
internal/README.md
internal/strategy.md
internal/conversation-summary.md
internal/kickoff-prompt.md

# Claude Code session state + per-PR worktrees. The worktrees contain
# full shadow copies of the repo (including the strategy docs above),
# so this MUST stay ignored — a future `git add -A` would otherwise
# promote them.
.claude/

# Demo / experiment substrate state. The repo root is occasionally
# used as a `rufio init` target during interactive work; the resulting
# directories (live/, rufio-live-demo/, the RUFIO.md primer copy)
# accumulate and have no business being in the public repo.
/live/
/rufio-live-demo/
RUFIO.md
AGENTS.md
rufio.gdl

